reg_decoder_fld_t tof3_mau_address_distribution_addrmap__mau_diag_32b_oxbar_ctl_fld_list[] = {
    { "diag_32b_oxbar_ctl", 19, 0, 0,0, 
      "Controls 9x4x32b Oxbar to select one of the 14 32b diagnostic groups.  Each of the 4 selected diagnostic groups are then passed through a 4x2x8b Oxbar to select 2 bytes for output to each of the 4 16b diagnostic bus slots. This register field contains 4 5b (1b enable plus 4b select) Oxbar controls to select one of the 14 32b diagnostic groups. Bits 4:0 control output 3 from the Oxbar Bits 9:5 control output 2 Bits 14:10 control output 1 Bits 19:15 control output 0 The diagnostic groups contain the following signals: Group8: 31:0  : Logical table N:N-1 action_instruction_address<<8>> (including read enable) mau_diag_32b_oxbar_premux_action_instr_ctl selects which group of 4.  Group7: 31:30 : ingress/egress input error (i_error<<2>>) 29:23 : table_active[6:0] 22:0  : (mau_diag_32b_oxbar_premux_actionidletime_ctl ? diagnostic idletime address (plus per-flow enable) : diagnostic action data address (plus per-flow enable);  Group6: 31:30 : ingress/egress input error (i_error<<2>>) 29:27 : mau_diag_32b_oxbar_premux_statsmeter_ctl ? table_active[6:0] : table_active[2:0]; 26:0  : mau_diag_32b_oxbar_premux_statsmeter_ctl ? diagnostic stats/meter premux address (plus address control[3:0]) : diagnostic meter address (plus address control[3:0]) ;  Group5: 31:16 : table_active 15:0  : logical table gateway inhibit  Group4 31:16 : table_active 15:0  : logical table hit (always 1 when gateway table inhibits the table)  Group3: 31:30 : egress EOP valid input 29:23 : egress EOP port ID 22    : egress header recirculate 21:16 : egress header port ID 15    : egress EOP valid input 14    : egress EOP recirculate 13:0  : egress EOP bytecount  Group2: 31:30 : ingress EOP valid input 29:23 : ingress EOP port ID 22    : ingress header recirculate 21:16 : ingress header port ID 15    : ingress EOP valid input 14    : ingress EOP recirculate 13:0  : ingress EOP bytecount  Group1: 31:29 : table_active[1:0] 28:21 : egress 9b next table output 20    : egress thread active input 19    : egress oPHV valid input 18    : egress error input 17:16 : egress pkt version input 15:13 : table_active[1:0] 12:5  : egress 9b start table input 4     : egress thread active input 3     : egress oPHV valid input 2     : egress error input 1:0   : egress pkt version input  Group0: 31:29 : table_active[1:0] 28:21 : ingress 9b next table output 20    : ingress thread active input 19    : ingress oPHV valid input 18    : ingress error input 17:16 : ingress pkt version input 15:13 : table_active[1:0] 12:5  : ingress 9b start table input 4     : ingress thread active input 3     : ingress oPHV valid input 2     : ingress error input 1:0   : ingress pkt version input " },
};
