reg_decoder_fld_t tof3_mau_match_merge_addrmap__predication_ctl_fld_list[] = {
    { "table_thread", 15, 0, 0,0, 
      "16 bits for 16 logical tables. Each bit says the table belongs in that thread. There is an array of 2 of these registers, The array index is for thread: 0 = ingress, 1 = egress. So each 16b vector says which tables belong to  its thread, ingress for the ingress array element  and egress for the egress array element." },
    { "start_table_fifo_delay0", 20, 16, 0,0, 
      "When start_table fifo0 is enabled, specifies the delay of this fifo. This should be set to the number of clock cycles of delay between the stages minus 3. For match dependency, this is given by: MAUprev(length) - MAUprev(predication cycle) + MAU(predication cycle) - 3 For the first MAU stage, this simplifies to: MAU(predication cycle) - 2 For action dependency, this needs to be programmed to 0" },
    { "start_table_fifo_delay1", 25, 21, 0,0, 
      "This FIFO is deprecated in JBay, use mpr_* CSRs" },
    { "start_table_fifo_enable", 27, 26, 0,0, 
      "Enable control for the two predication FIFOs delaying start_table input. Bit 0 enables start_table_fifo_delay0, which is used to delay start_table until this stage's predication cycle. Bit 0 is enabled if this stage is match dependent on the previous stage or is the first stage. Disable Bit 0 if this stage is action dependent on the previous stage. Bit 1 is deprecated in JBay, use mpr_* CSRs." },
};
